@startuml
' Sem skinparam aqui: a paleta e injetada por tools/render-puml.py
' para gerar as variantes light e dark a partir desta mesma fonte.

actor Creator
participant "Next.js\nWorkspace" as WEB
participant "APScheduler" as SCHED
participant "Trend engine" as TREND
participant "Claim lock\nbegin_immediate" as LOCK
participant "Script gen\n(Claude / GPT)" as SCRIPT
participant "Safety gate" as SAFE
participant "Video pipeline\n(ffmpeg)" as PIPE
participant "Review queue" as REVIEW
participant "Publisher" as PUB
database "SQLite" as DB

== Trend detection (every 30 min) ==
SCHED -> TREND : run detection for user
TREND -> TREND : 3 sources in parallel\nThreadPool, 15s timeout each
TREND -> TREND : normalize per source, recency decay,\nweighted merge, fuzzy dedupe, velocity
TREND -> DB : persist top trends + context

== Claim then work ==
SCHED -> LOCK : acquire
LOCK -> DB : SELECT ... FOR UPDATE\nINSERT placeholder row
LOCK --> SCHED : release
note right of LOCK
  Slow I/O stays OUTSIDE the lock.
  Holding it across LLM and ffmpeg
  calls cascaded "database is locked"
end note

== Generation ==
SCHED -> SCRIPT : generate script for trend
SCRIPT -> SCRIPT : compose system prompt\nniche + duration + archetype + base
SCRIPT -> SCRIPT : parse, enforce scene count\nand word cap
SCRIPT --> DB : status = script_ready

SCHED -> SAFE : check script
SAFE --> SCHED : pass (before any paid call)

SCHED -> PIPE : assemble video
PIPE -> PIPE : voiceover + word timings,\nfootage per scene with fallback,\nASS captions, Ken Burns, -14 LUFS
PIPE -> DB : status = ready
PIPE -> REVIEW : create review item\n(in finally — success OR failure)

== Human gate ==
Creator -> WEB : opens review queue
WEB -> REVIEW : GET pending items
REVIEW --> Creator : video preview + hook/body/CTA
Creator -> WEB : Approve
WEB -> REVIEW : status = approved

== Publish ==
REVIEW -> PUB : dispatch by channel
PUB -> PUB : refresh OAuth token if expiring
PUB -> DB : status = posting
PUB --> Creator : published + AI disclosure required
PUB -> DB : status = posted, delete local MP4

@enduml
